### ==============================================================================
### TULSI MART ENTERPRISE REST API COLLECTION
### Tested & Verified with FastAPI + Redis + SQLite/MySQL
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refresh_token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH CHECKS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Root API & Server Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 System & Redis Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & LOGIN ATTEMPT LIMITING
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Merchant Registration
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tulsi Store Owner",
  "email": "owner_tulsi@nmart.com",
  "phone": "+91-9876543210",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "storeType": "Grocery Store",
  "store_name": "Tulsi Super Mart"
}

### 2.2 Successful Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@nmart.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.3 Wrong Login Attempt (Tests "Incorrect email or password. You have X attempts left.")
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@nmart.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

### 2.4 Token Refresh (Enforces Refresh Token Rotation & 7-Day Validity)
# @name refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 2.5 Get Authenticated User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.6 Forgot Password (OTP Generation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@nmart.com"
}

### 2.7 Verify OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@nmart.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 2.8 Reset Password (Min 8 chars, Upper, Lower, Number, Special)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@nmart.com",
  "otp": "123456",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 2.9 Logout (Blacklists Access & Refresh Tokens in Redis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. PRODUCTS & CATALOG (Redis Caching & Invalidation)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 List Products (Cached with Redis key: tulsimart:products:list:*)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Search Products with Category & Stock Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=Rice&status_filter=active&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.3 Create New Product (Invalidates Redis Product Cache)
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_name": "Premium Sona Masoori Rice 5kg",
  "sku": "RICE-SONA-5KG",
  "barcode": "8901234567890",
  "selling_price": 350.0,
  "purchase_price": 280.0,
  "unit": "kg",
  "status": "active",
  "opening_stock": 50,
  "min_stock_level": 10
}

### 3.4 Get Product Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.5 Update Product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_name": "Premium Sona Masoori Rice 5kg (Updated)",
  "selling_price": 360.0
}

### 3.6 Delete Product (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. CATEGORIES (Redis Caching & Dynamic Attributes)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 List Store Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.2 Create New Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dairy & Beverages",
  "code": "dairy_beverages",
  "description": "Milk, butter, cheeses, cold drinks, juices"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. CART & USER SESSION (Synced in Redis with TTL)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Get User Cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.2 Add / Update Cart Item
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "1",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unit_price": 350.0,
  "notes": "Fragile packing requested"
}

### 5.3 Delete Item From Cart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.4 Clear Entire Cart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. WISHLIST & FAVORITES
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Get Wishlist
GET {{baseUrl}}/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6.2 Add Product to Wishlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/wishlist/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6.3 Remove Product from Wishlist
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/wishlist/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. KHATABOOK CUSTOMER LEDGER & PAYMENTS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 List Customers with Ledger Balances
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7.2 Get Customer Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7.3 Get Complete Customer Ledger & Bills History
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/1/ledger
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7.4 Record Customer Partial / Full Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/1/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500.0,
  "payment_method": "UPI",
  "payment_date": "2026-11-21T18:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Payment via Google Pay ref #GPAY998811"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. SALES INVOICES & POS BILLING
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 8.1 Create Retail Bill / POS Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "payment_method": "CASH",
  "payment_status": "PAID",
  "paid_amount": 700.0,
  "discount_amount": 0.0,
  "tax_amount": 35.0,
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unit_price": 350.0,
      "discount_amount": 0.0,
      "tax_rate": 5.0
    }
  ]
}

### 8.2 View Invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. INVENTORY & STOCK MOVEMENTS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 9.1 Stock Inward
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/stock-in
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 25,
  "reason": "Supplier shipment received"
}

### 9.2 Low Stock Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. BUSINESS REPORTS & DASHBOARD
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 10.1 Dashboard Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10.2 Sales Analytics (7 Days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/sales-analytics?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
